WEBVTT

00:03:29.613 --> 00:03:32.616
rooting for us, acting crazy
on social media right now --

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:33.799
we see you.

00:03:33.823 --> 00:03:34.831
(Laughter)

00:03:34.855 --> 00:03:37.293
We see you every day. We love you.

00:03:37.317 --> 00:03:38.666
You are not alone,

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:41.501
and our bigger work starts now.

00:03:41.525 --> 00:03:44.121
VG: You got us onto this stage --

00:03:44.145 --> 00:03:45.649
your leadership;

00:03:45.673 --> 00:03:48.416
auditing blighted streets in Detroit;

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:51.784
working with hospitals
and health care systems in Harlem;

00:03:51.808 --> 00:03:57.264
praying over the streets of Sacramento,
Charlotte, Brooklyn, Flint

00:03:57.288 --> 00:04:00.190
and every community that has seen trauma;